# Sediment bacterial communities associated with Macrocystis pyrifera forests
# Analyses and figures for the manuscript
#
# This script starts from the final filtered phyloseq object used for the
# statistical analyses (Sed_16S_filtered.rds project 2). The object should contain the non-rarefied ASV count
# table, SILVA taxonomy (v.138.2), sample metadata (Env project 2), and sediment geochemical variables.
#
# Upstream sequence processing (DADA2), contaminant removal (microDecon), and
# removal of ASVs detected in only one biological.
#
# Expected input:
#   data/Sed_16S_filtered.rds
#
# Expected sample_data columns:
#   Type, Site, Date, Organic_Matter, Total_N, Olsen_P
#
# Site levels:
#   Bahia_Buzo, San_Gregorio, Buque_Quemado
# Date levels:
#   August, March

